meta {
  name: Get By ID - Unauthorized Access
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/applied-jobs/PROPOSAL_UUID
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{unrelatedUserAuthToken}}
}

docs {
  ## Get Applied Job Detail — Unauthorized Access (Unrelated User)

  A valid authenticated user who is neither the applicant nor the job owner
  should receive a 404 (not found / access denied).

  Replace `{{unrelatedUserAuthToken}}` with the JWT of a user who has no
  connection to this proposal.

  ### Expected Response (404)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "Not found"
  }
  ```
}
